Subject: [PATCH 1032/3799] soh: rename func_808A91AC ->
 BgRelayObjects_WaitToClose

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: ticks the race timer with its warning sfx and closes the door when the time runs out or the player reaches this door's room.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Relay_Objects/z_bg_relay_objects.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
